{"unit_id":"42c06b4b3ea7c33f3d17","title":"提案二: 有關糖尿病用藥GLP-1 RA 是否可互換？","kind":"proposal","blocks":[{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-07fad65d2a17d3780867-p3-b1","raw_text":"提案二: 有關糖尿病用藥GLP-1 RA 是否可互換？ \n","start_char":0,"end_char":29,"bbox":[36.0,47.216041564941406,392.0500183105469,63.17604064941406]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-07fad65d2a17d3780867-p3-b2","raw_text":"說明: 原則上符合GLP-1 RA 藥物給付規定並檢附起始治療的相關病歷與檢 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":40,"bbox":[36.0,77.23600006103516,567.4199829101562,93.19599914550781]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-07fad65d2a17d3780867-p3-b3","raw_text":"      驗報告, 得互相轉換; 轉換後治療劑量尊重臨床醫師裁量。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":36,"bbox":[36.0,107.23600006103516,507.9000244140625,123.19599914550781]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-07fad65d2a17d3780867-p3-b4","raw_text":"決議：照案通過，如說明段。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":15,"bbox":[35.400001525878906,137.23599243164062,251.38999938964844,153.1959991455078]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-07fad65d2a17d3780867-p3-b5","raw_text":" \n","start_char":0,"end_char":2,"bbox":[35.400001525878906,167.23599243164062,43.380001068115234,183.1959991455078]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-07fad65d2a17d3780867-p3-b6","raw_text":" \n","start_char":0,"end_char":2,"bbox":[35.400001525878906,197.23599243164062,43.380001068115234,213.1959991455078]}],"source_quality":[]}